{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:43:12+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T07:43:12+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"RHI Magnesita N.V.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Metal Fabrication","country":"Austria","city":"Vienna","website":"https://www.rhimagnesita.com","employees":20000,"summary":"RHI Magnesita N.V., together with its subsidiaries, develops, produces, sells, installs, and maintains refractory products and systems used in industrial high-temperature processes worldwide. The company offers magnesite and dolomite, and refractory bricks, as well as mixes, mortars and castables, and functional specialized refractory products. It also provides refractory engineering solutions, such as drawings or design of a linings concept, installation, supervision, maintenance, and recycling. In addition, the company offers systems, sensors, machinery, and digital products; and sells internally produced raw materials, such as magnesite ore, dead-burned magnesia, and fused magnesia. Additionally, it offers raw magnesite, caustic magnesia, sintered magnesia, dolomite and sintered dolomite, magnesia products, slag conditioners, magnesium oxide, spinels, agalmatolite, chromite, grogs, and commodities. The company serves customers in steel, cement, metals, lime, non-ferrous metals, glass, energy, environmental, and chemicals industries. RHI Magnesita N.V. was founded in 1834 and is headquartered in Vienna, Austria.","exchange":"LSE","currency":"GBp","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"RHI Magnesita N.V., en collaboration avec ses filiales, développe, produit, vend, installe et entretient des produits réfractaires et des systèmes utilisés dans les processus industriels à haute température dans le monde entier. La société propose de la magnésite et de la dolomie, des briques réfractaires, ainsi que des mélanges, des mortiers et des coulées, et des produits réfractaires spécialisés fonctionnels. Il fournit également des solutions d'ingénierie réfractaire, telles que des dessins ou la conception d'un concept de revêtements, l'installation, la supervision, la maintenance et le recyclage."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":1307492224,"shares_outstanding":47372908,"trailing_pe":14.450262,"forward_pe":6.560429,"price_to_book":140.26706,"ev_to_ebitda":6.756,"ev_to_revenue":0.905,"dividend_yield":0.0585,"payout_ratio":0.7895,"beta_yahoo":1.413},"targets":{"current_price":2760.0,"mean":3321.1707,"median":3405.5242,"high":4248.059,"low":2251.0032,"n_analysts":5,"reco_mean":null,"reco_key":"none"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-07-31"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":null,"ex_dividend":"2026-08-27","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.45445,"institutions_pct":0.52409,"institutions_float_pct":0.96065,"institutions_n":74,"institutions":[],"funds":[{"name":"Fidelity Investment Trust-Fidelity International Small Cap Fund","pct":0.0223,"shares":1056191,"value":2915087160,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"Fidelity Puritan Trust-Fidelity Low-Priced Stock Fund","pct":0.01,"shares":472600,"value":1304376000,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"American Century ETF Trust-Avantis International Small Cap Value ETF","pct":0.0067000003,"shares":319393,"value":881524680,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0343},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0052,"shares":247182,"value":682222320,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.015800001},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.004,"shares":190258,"value":525112080,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0115},{"name":"Fidelity Rutland Square TRT II-Strategic Advisers Fidelity U.S. Total ","pct":0.0038,"shares":181180,"value":500056800,"date":"2026-08-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0034999999,"shares":165635,"value":457152600,"date":"2026-06-30","chg